    "Only source-provided id/aliases are used for transitive identity matching; related/upstream and package names do not establish identity.",
    "Public evidence contains allowlisted structured fields and original-content digests only, not raw HTML/XML/API bodies, advisory descriptions, private-report references, code examples, credentials or tracking metadata.",
    "MyJVN census covers all product/CPE rows in the selected modification-date window, not an exhaustive package mapping. No results returned in this window does not mean the outstanding library candidate backlog is empty.",
